    'Hello,<br /><br />You have been invited by <strong>{{USER:NAME}}</strong> ({{USER:EMAIL}}) to join the <strong>{{TEAM:NAME}}</strong> team on {{WEBSITE_TITLE}}.<br /><br />Click here to <a href="{{LOGIN_LINK}}" class="cta">login and accept invitation</a>.<br /><br />Regards,<br />The {{WEBSITE_TITLE}} team.' => 'Hallo,<br /><br /><strong>{{USER:NAME}}</strong> ({{USER:EMAIL}}) hat dich eingeladen, dem Team <strong>{{TEAM:NAME}}</strong> auf {{WEBSITE_TITLE}} beizutreten.<br /><br />Klicke hier, um dich <a href="{{LOGIN_LINK}}" class="cta">anzumelden und die Einladung anzunehmen</a>.<br /><br />Viele Grüße<br />Das Team von {{WEBSITE_TITLE}}.',
